    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Global Properties Ltd. presents this modern two bed apartment in Ovens offering huge opportunities for either first time buyers or investors alike. Minutes from shops, the bus stop, bars, restaurants, the South Link, viewing is highly advised. \r\n\r\nBallincollig is a lively suburb located just west of Cork City. It is known for its friendly community, beautiful parks, historic Ballincollig Regional Park as well as numerous heritage sites. The town has a mix of modern shops, schools, cafés, and sports facilities, making it a popular place to live.  The location is within easy reach of all services and amenities available in Ballincollig, as well as having a local shop and a bus stop for a 24-hour bus route to Cork City within walking distance from the property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway\r\nLaminate wood flooring providing access to all rooms and hot press. Feature storage cabinets.\r\n\r\nKitchen - 9'0\" x 6'11\"\r\nFully fitted kitchen with floor and eye level units, tiled splash back and tiled floors.\r\n\r\nLiving / Dining Area -16'2\" x 12'9\"\r\nThe Living/dining area comfortably fits a dining table and couch. Laminate wood floors and curtains.\r\nSliding door provides both light and access to the South facing balcony area.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 8'10\" x 6'7\"\r\nW.C, W.H.B, bath, with shower insert and tiled throughout.\r\n\r\nPrimary Bedroom -16'8\" x 8'10\"\r\nBright and spacious double room with laminate wood flooring, built in wardrobe with and access to an\r\nensuite.\r\n\r\nEnsuite- 5'0\" x 4'10\"\r\nW.C, wash hand basin, shower and tiled throughout.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 11'0\" x 10'10\"\r\nBright and spacious double bedroom with wardrobe and laminate wood flooring"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Modern Living\r\nSecure keypad entry\r\nGas Fired Central Heating\r\nGreat Condition\r\nAmple Parking\r\nLandscaped communal gardens\r\nExcellent Location\r\nWithin Close Proximity to Schools, Shops & 24 Hour Bus Service"
      },
